From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:50:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build(win): call trusted win_bison/win_flex instead of
 bundled Bison.exe/Flex.exe

The MSVC projects invoke bare 'bison'/'flex', which resolve to the
unverified Tools.Win32/Bison.exe and Flex.exe via ExecutablePath.
Rename the custom-build commands to win_bison/win_flex (WinFlexBison
2.5.25: bison 3.8.2, flex 2.6.4) so the trusted tools on PATH are
used. No other change to the commands.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 SamTFE/Sources/Ecc/Ecc.vcxproj                | 16 +++++-----
 SamTFE/Sources/Engine/Engine.vcxproj          | 32 +++++++++----------
 .../SeriousSkaStudio/SeriousSkaStudio.vcxproj | 16 +++++-----
 SamTSE/Sources/Ecc/Ecc.vcxproj                | 16 +++++-----
 SamTSE/Sources/Engine/Engine.vcxproj          | 32 +++++++++----------
 .../SeriousSkaStudio/SeriousSkaStudio.vcxproj | 16 +++++-----
 6 files changed, 64 insertions(+), 64 deletions(-)

